2026-11-13T10:02:14.1679420Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1680178Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1680849Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1681107Z 
