2026-11-13T10:02:14.1688337Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1688729Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1689114Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1689659Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1690201Z    /root
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1699368Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1699947Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1710215Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1710736Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-13T10:02:14.1711091Z 
